{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ink &amp; Cursor: Demo is the work in progress of a cozy, creature collector and deck builder like game in which you need to save animals from the spreading ink and invasive monsters.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the cursor as your controller, combine, assemble and fix the world of dozens of hand drawn animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple click-and-move gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three of the Eight biomes that will be present in the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three of Ten types of enemies that will seek to destroy your animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai simulation that allows the animals to move on their own, flee from enemies when injured, and find food !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First building type: Lamps to keep the enemies at bay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A recipe book in progress, in which you will see new animals get added until the full release!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982740/extras/bed21bc5f450776e3708dbe301dd31d0.poster.avif?t=1756861687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982740/extras/bed21bc5f450776e3708dbe301dd31d0.webm?t=1756861687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982740/extras/bed21bc5f450776e3708dbe301dd31d0.mp4?t=1756861687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this first little project from Paperfox Entertainment, and join us on this journey!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982740?t=1756861687","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982740?t=1756861687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982740/ee587c97eea0b687abe757d57c5d2ac3ba7ddcf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756861687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982740/ee587c97eea0b687abe757d57c5d2ac3ba7ddcf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756861687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ink &amp; Cursor: Demo is the work in progress of a cozy, creature collector and deck builder like game in which you need to save animals from the spreading ink and invasive monsters.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the cursor as your controller, combine, assemble and fix the world of dozens of hand drawn animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Demo features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple click-and-move gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three of the Eight biomes that will be present in the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three of Ten types of enemies that will seek to destroy your animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai simulation that allows the animals to move on their own, flee from enemies when injured, and find food !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First building type: Lamps to keep the enemies at bay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A recipe book in progress, in which you will see new animals get added until the full release!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po